    "AMDSummary" : [
      {
        "language" : "es",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "target" : "Esta acción abre la aplicación seleccionada. Si dicha aplicación ya está abierta, pasará a estar activa."
      },
      {
        "language" : "nl",
        "target" : "Met deze taak open je de gekozen app. Als de app al geopend is, wordt de app actief.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable"
      },
      {
        "target" : "這項動作啟動所選應用程式，如果應用程式已經執行，則它會成為現用中的應用程式。",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "language" : "zh_TW"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Ta czynność uruchamia wybraną aplikację. Gdy aplikacja jest uruchomiona, staje się aktywna.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "language" : "pl"
      },
      {
        "language" : "en_AU",
        "target" : "This action launches the chosen application. If the application is already running, it becomes active.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable"
      },
      {
        "target" : "This action launches the chosen application. If the application is already running, it becomes active.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "language" : "en_GB"
      },
      {
        "language" : "id",
        "target" : "Tindakan ini meluncurkan aplikasi yang dipilih. Jika aplikasi sudah berjalan, aplikasi menjadi aktif.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "pt_PT",
        "target" : "Esta ação inicia a aplicação selecionada. Se a aplicação já estiver em execução, torna‑se ativa.",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable"
      },
      {
        "target" : "Denne handling starter den valgte app. Hvis appen er startet, bliver den aktiv.",
        "language" : "da",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable"
      },
      {
        "language" : "hi",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "target" : "यह क्रिया चुने गए ऐप्लिकेशन लॉन्च करती है। यदि ऐप्लिकेशन पहले से ही चल रहा है, तो वह सक्रिय हो जाता है।"
      },
      {
        "language" : "ru",
        "filename" : "InfoPlist.loctable",
        "target" : "Данное действие запускает выбранную программу. Если программа уже открыта, она становится активной."
      },
      {
        "language" : "fr_CA",
